 156+ 6D08              ; ==============================================================================
 157+ 6D08              ; External call thunks - usados desde el body bank 7 para llamar a rutinas
 158+ 6D08              ; que viven en bank 0 (o en slot 1 que internamente toca bank 0).
 159+ 6D08              ; ==============================================================================
 160+ 6D08              ; Patron: body bank 7 hace `CALL <Func>_B7`. El thunk pagina bank 0, llama a
 161+ 6D08              ; la funcion real, repagina bank 7, y RETurnea al body. Args en HL/BC/DE/A/IX
 162+ 6D08              ; quedan intactos (_PageBank0 / _PageBank7 preservan AF + BC via PUSH/POP).
 163+ 6D08              ;
 164+ 6D08              ; CRITICO: el body bank 7 NO puede llamar _PageBank0 directamente — al volver,
 165+ 6D08              ; slot 3 estaria en bank 0 y el RET aterrizaria en bank 0 (no en bank 7) =
 166+ 6D08              ; crash. Por eso cada wrap vive como thunk individual en slot 1 (always-vis).
 167+ 6D08              ; ==============================================================================
 168+ 6D08
 169+ 6D08              ; --- bank 0 callees (paginar bank 0 antes, restaurar bank 7 al RET) ---
 170+ 6D08
 171+ 6D08              DrawBgSpriteXOR_B7:
 172+ 6D08 CD 86 6C         CALL _PageBank0
 173+ 6D0B CD D6 DB         CALL DrawBgSpriteXOR
 174+ 6D0E C3 98 6C         JP _PageBank7
 175+ 6D11
 176+ 6D11              ; DrawBgGfxSprite_B7 - draw + flags. El unico caller del body bank 7 es
 177+ 6D11              ; BankCutsceneCloseDoorRestoreAttrs, que necesita BgSpriteIsHouse=0 y
 178+ 6D11              ; CurrentTintVar=$FF antes del draw. Esas vars viven en BANK 0, asi que
 179+ 6D11              ; se escriben aqui DENTRO del wrap pre-paginated. Antes era un thunk
 180+ 6D11              ; aparte (DrawBankDoorSprite_B7) pero combinar ahorra 18 B en slot 1 —
 181+ 6D11              ; critico para que magic_compass.asm no cruce $7A00 (im2 table).
 182+ 6D11              DrawBgGfxSprite_B7:
 183+ 6D11 CD 86 6C         CALL _PageBank0
 184+ 6D14 AF               XOR A
 185+ 6D15 32 5A E3         LD (BgSpriteIsHouse), A
 186+ 6D18 3E FF            LD A, $FF
 187+ 6D1A 32 6D D2         LD (CurrentTintVar), A
 188+ 6D1D CD 63 D1         CALL DrawBgGfxSprite
 189+ 6D20 C3 98 6C         JP _PageBank7
 190+ 6D23
 191+ 6D23              RedrawPickupByPtr_B7:
 192+ 6D23 CD 86 6C         CALL _PageBank0
 193+ 6D26 CD 07 D8         CALL RedrawPickupByPtr
 194+ 6D29 C3 98 6C         JP _PageBank7
 195+ 6D2C
 196+ 6D2C              PlaySFX_B7:                              ; HL = SFX data ptr (en bank 0)
 197+ 6D2C CD 86 6C         CALL _PageBank0
 198+ 6D2F CD 24 F9         CALL PlaySFX
 199+ 6D32 C3 98 6C         JP _PageBank7
 200+ 6D35
 201+ 6D35              CheckMilestoneTrigger_B7:                ; A = action id
 202+ 6D35 CD 86 6C         CALL _PageBank0
 203+ 6D38 CD 56 EF         CALL CheckMilestoneTrigger
 204+ 6D3B C3 98 6C         JP _PageBank7
 205+ 6D3E
 206+ 6D3E              ; --- slot 1 callee con dependencia bank 0 interna ---
