 567+ 7F36              ; --- ApplyMusicSpeedShift: A=duration in/out. SRL N veces, clamp a 1 ----------
 568+ 7F36              ; MusicSpeedShift = 0 → no-op. Mantiene el comportamiento "tempo / 2^N".
 569+ 7F36              ApplyMusicSpeedShift:
 570+ 7F36 47               LD B, A
 571+ 7F37 3A D9 99         LD A, (MusicSpeedShift)
 572+ 7F3A B7               OR A
