 707+ 90B9
 708+ 90B9 79               LD A, C
 709+ 90BA B7               OR A
 710+ 90BB 20 05            JR NZ, .mosHaveMatch
 711+ 90BD
 712+ 90BD                  ; Sin matches en este side
 713+ 90BD C1               POP BC
 714+ 90BE E1               POP HL
 715+ 90BF C3 EF 90         JP .mosNoGaps
 716+ 90C2
 717+ 90C2              .mosHaveMatch:
 718+ 90C2                  ; C = count of matches. Pick random idx (into A, keep off C/B registers).
 719+ 90C2 41               LD B, C                         ; B = matches (divisor)
 720+ 90C3 ED 5F            LD A, R
 721+ 90C5              .mosMod:
 722+ 90C5 B8               CP B
