1123+ A511 E6 F8            AND $F8
1124+ A513 32 7B 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1125+ A516 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1126+ A519 ED 79            OUT (C), A
1127+ A51B C9               RET
