2061+ AA4D              UpdateStamina:
2062+ AA4D                  ; --- Regenerar salud (1 unidad cada HEALTH_REGEN_RATE = 100 f = 4 s) ---
2063+ AA4D 3A 4B B3         LD A, (PlayerHealth)
2064+ AA50 FE 10            CP HEALTH_MAX
2065+ AA52 28 12            JR Z, .usHealthFull
