4197+ B641 73               LD (HL), E
4198+ B642 23               INC HL
4199+ B643 72               LD (HL), D
4200+ B644                  ; Incrementar counter
4201+ B644 3A 7B 5F         LD A, (PendingEraseCount)
4202+ B647 3C               INC A
4203+ B648 32 7B 5F         LD (PendingEraseCount), A
