5885+ BF6F 0F               RRCA
5886+ BF70 0F               RRCA
5887+ BF71 0F               RRCA
5888+ BF72 E6 1F            AND $1F
5889+ BF74 32 B8 97         LD (MaiGapTargetCoord), A
