5967+ BFFA 21 80 8D         LD HL, MonsterRoomId
5968+ BFFD 19               ADD HL, DE
5969+ BFFE 77               LD (HL), A
5970+ BFFF C1               POP BC
5971+ C000 E1               POP HL
5972+ C001              .rmRtNext:
5973+ C001 11 10 00         LD DE, ENT_SIZE
5974+ C004 DD 19            ADD IX, DE
5975+ C006 23               INC HL
