7022+ C614 DD 36 01 05      LD (IX+ENT_TYPE), TYPE_DEATH
7023+ C618 DD 36 02 01      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_RUNNING
7024+ C61C DD 36 00 64      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_DEATH
