7051+ C65A              ; --- UpdateDeathTimer: tick + spawn check (llamado cada frame desde main.asm) ---
7052+ C65A              UpdateDeathTimer:
7053+ C65A                  IF DEBUG_NO_ENEMIES
7054+ C65A ~                RET
7055+ C65A                  ENDIF
7056+ C65A 3A F3 82         LD A, (DeathSpawned)
