7085+ C67C 23               INC HL
7086+ C67D 22 F0 82         LD (DeathScreenTimer), HL
7087+ C680 E5               PUSH HL
7088+ C681 11 FA 00         LD DE, DEATH_SPAWN_FRAMES
7089+ C684 B7               OR A
7090+ C685 ED 52            SBC HL, DE
