7588+ C947 32 B0 82         LD (CurrentObjective), A
7589+ C94A 32 A7 82         LD (CurrentKey), A
7590+ C94D 32 AB 82         LD (ChurchEverOpened), A
7591+ C950 32 AA 82         LD (ChurchDoorOpen), A
7592+ C953 32 AC 82         LD (TimeFrozen), A
7593+ C956 32 A9 82         LD (ChurchKeySpawned), A
