7598+ C965 32 B7 82         LD (MonsterTrappedFlags), A
7599+ C968 32 F3 82         LD (DeathSpawned), A
7600+ C96B 32 C1 82         LD (TownGatePhase), A
7601+ C96E 32 BF 82         LD (ChurchCutscenePhase), A
7602+ C971 32 55 E3         LD (CurrentTimeOfDay), A            ; fase 0 = DY
7603+ C974 32 AF 82         LD (BellsTriggered), A
7604+ C977 32 B8 82         LD (NextChurchTrapStep), A
