7615+ C998 32 E5 82         LD (PlayerRespawnTimer), A
7616+ C99B 32 E6 82         LD (PlayerRespawnBlinkTimer), A
7617+ C99E 32 E8 82         LD (PlayerRespawnBeatIdx), A
7618+ C9A1 32 D9 82         LD (GameOverAnimX), A
7619+ C9A4 32 DA 82         LD (GameOverAnimDir), A
7620+ C9A7 32 DB 82         LD (GameOverAnimFrame), A
