7653+ C9ED
7654+ C9ED              OnPlayerHealthDepleted:
7655+ C9ED                  ; Cancelar magic compass: el power-up se pierde con la muerte (refuerza
7656+ C9ED                  ; coste real). Idempotente si no estaba activo.
7657+ C9ED CD D7 6D         CALL CancelMagicCompass
7658+ C9F0                  ; Silenciar inmediatamente cualquier musica activa (DeathMusic o cualquier
7659+ C9F0                  ; otra). Va ANTES de AY_PlayPlayerDeath: ambos usan canal B, sin este stop
7660+ C9F0                  ; el sweep clobbearia residuos. Es el punto canonico de "player muere"
7661+ C9F0                  ; (combate, Death catch, drain de salud por cualquier via).
7662+ C9F0 F5               PUSH AF
7663+ C9F1 3E FF            LD A, $FF
7664+ C9F3 CD B3 99         CALL StartMusic
7665+ C9F6 F1               POP AF
7666+ C9F7                  ; Tambien parar el secuencer ad-hoc de MonstersMusic (no va por el driver
7667+ C9F7                  ; tabular; tiene su propia variable de estado MonstersMusicStep).
7668+ C9F7 CD 1F FB         CALL StopMonstersMusic
7669+ C9FA                  ; SFX de muerte (sweep largo agudo→muy grave + decay lento ~2s).
7670+ C9FA                  ; No bloqueante, canal B. Va antes que el resto para no perder el ataque.
7671+ C9FA CD AF 6A         CALL AY_PlayPlayerDeath
7672+ C9FD                  ; Congelar tiempo (silencioso, sin parpadeo de la esfera). El feedback
7673+ C9FD                  ; visual ya viene del border yellow/red. Limpiado en urb1LastBeat.
7674+ C9FD 3E 02            LD A, 2
7675+ C9FF 32 AC 82         LD (TimeFrozen), A
7676+ CA02                  ; Guardar tumba en la posicion donde ha muerto (player POSX/POSY actuales)
7677+ CA02 CD D6 68         CALL TombStore
7678+ CA05                  ; Despawn de todos los nasties activos con puff (visual de "shockwave")
7679+ CA05 CD 26 BA         CALL KillAllActiveNasties
7680+ CA08                  ; La muerte (slot 11) tambien desaparece, pero sin puff
7681+ CA08 CD F4 BA         CALL SilentKillDeath
7682+ CA0B                  ; Monsters quedan congelados mirando al cadaver hasta que vuelva el control
7683+ CA0B CD 0F BB         CALL FreezeMonstersFacingCorpse
7684+ CA0E                  ; Trigger del flash del borde: 2s amarillo (anim muerte) + 3s rojo (invisible) o GAME OVER
7685+ CA0E CD B7 CA         CALL TriggerDeathBorder
7686+ CA11                  ; Override sprite a frame 0 de la anim de muerte. ProcessPlayer en la
7687+ CA11                  ; siguiente frame hara .plDoErase (erase del sprite anterior + draw del
7688+ CA11                  ; nuevo) automaticamente porque SPRITEID != OLDSPRID.
7689+ CA11 DD 21 94 81      LD IX, EntityTable
7690+ CA15                  ; Base de la anim segun lastHDir (bits 4-7 de ENT_DIR): DIR_W<<4 = $80
7691+ CA15 DD 7E 0A         LD A, (IX+ENT_DIR)
7692+ CA18 E6 80            AND $80
7693+ CA1A 3E 6E            LD A, SPRID_PLAYER_DEATH            ; default = right base (110)
7694+ CA1C 28 02            JR Z, .ophdRightBase
7695+ CA1E 3E 71            LD A, SPRID_PLAYER_DEATH_LEFT       ; lastHDir = W → left base (113)
7696+ CA20              .ophdRightBase:
7697+ CA20 DD 77 00         LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), A
7698+ CA23 DD 36 06 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAX), 0
7699+ CA27 DD 36 07 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAY), 0
7700+ CA2B 3E 0D            LD A, PLAYER_DEATH_ANIM_DELAY
7701+ CA2D 32 E2 82         LD (PlayerDeathAnimTimer), A
7702+ CA30 AF               XOR A
7703+ CA31 32 E3 82         LD (PlayerDeathAnimFrame), A
7704+ CA34                  ; Decrementar vida (clamp a 0)
7705+ CA34 3A D7 82         LD A, (PlayerLives)
7706+ CA37 B7               OR A
7707+ CA38 C8               RET Z
7708+ CA39 3D               DEC A
7709+ CA3A 32 D7 82         LD (PlayerLives), A
7710+ CA3D C9               RET
7711+ CA3E
7712+ CA3E              ; --- ErasePlayerSpriteAtOldPos: XOR-redraw del ultimo sprite + restore attrs ---
7713+ CA3E              ; Mismo patron que .plDoErase: GetOldSpriteAddr -> DrawSprite -> RestoreOldAttr.
7714+ CA3E              ErasePlayerSpriteAtOldPos:
7715+ CA3E DD 21 94 81      LD IX, EntityTable
7716+ CA42 CD ED A4         CALL GetOldSpriteAddr
7717+ CA45 DD 56 0D         LD D, (IX+ENT_OLDY)
7718+ CA48 DD 7E 0C         LD A, (IX+ENT_OLDX)
7719+ CA4B 5F               LD E, A
7720+ CA4C DD E5            PUSH IX
7721+ CA4E DD 2A 75 A4      LD IX, (OldSprAddr)
7722+ CA52 CD E0 99         CALL DrawSprite
7723+ CA55 DD E1            POP IX
7724+ CA57 DD 56 0D         LD D, (IX+ENT_OLDY)
7725+ CA5A DD 5E 0C         LD E, (IX+ENT_OLDX)
7726+ CA5D C3 15 D3         JP RestoreOldAttr                   ; tail-call
7727+ CA60
7728+ CA60              ; --- RespawnPlayerAtEntry: mover a LastEntryPos, refill HP/stamina, NEWSPAWN ---
7729+ CA60              RespawnPlayerAtEntry:
7730+ CA60 DD 21 94 81      LD IX, EntityTable
7731+ CA64 3A 07 83         LD A, (LastEntryPosX)
7732+ CA67 DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
7733+ CA6A DD 77 0C         LD (IX+ENT_OLDX), A
7734+ CA6D DD 77 0F         LD (IX+ENT_DRAWX), A
7735+ CA70 3A 08 83         LD A, (LastEntryPosY)
7736+ CA73 DD 77 04         LD (IX+ENT_POSY), A
7737+ CA76 DD 77 0D         LD (IX+ENT_OLDY), A
7738+ CA79 3E 10            LD A, HEALTH_MAX
7739+ CA7B 32 4B B3         LD (PlayerHealth), A
7740+ CA7E 3E 10            LD A, STAMINA_MAX
7741+ CA80 32 4C B3         LD (PlayerStamina), A
7742+ CA83 DD 36 00 00      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_IDLE
7743+ CA87 DD 36 0E 00      LD (IX+ENT_OLDSPRID), SPRID_IDLE
7744+ CA8B DD 36 08 00      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), SPRID_IDLE
7745+ CA8F DD 36 02 00      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_IDLE
7746+ CA93 DD 36 06 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAX), 0
7747+ CA97 DD 36 07 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAY), 0
7748+ CA9B                  ; Reset color a blanco + cooldowns: si moriste con AttackCooldown activo
7749+ CA9B                  ; (modo B post-swing), ENT_ATTR estaba en BLUE. Sin esto, el azul stale
7750+ CA9B                  ; persiste tras respawn porque SelectSwordMode ve stamina=MAX -> modo
7751+ CA9B                  ; libre, y .swordModeFree no toca el color.
7752+ CA9B DD 36 05 47      LD (IX+ENT_ATTR), WHITE | $40
7753+ CA9F AF               XOR A
7754+ CAA0 32 47 B3         LD (AttackCooldown), A
7755+ CAA3 32 46 B3         LD (AttackTimer), A
7756+ CAA6 DD CB 0B DE      SET ENTF_NEWSPAWN, (IX+ENT_FLAGS)
7757+ CAAA                  ; Activar phase 1 del respawn: countdown 3-2-1 con bips.
7758+ CAAA                  ; Timer=0 -> primer beat al siguiente frame. BeatIdx=0.
7759+ CAAA 3E 01            LD A, 1
7760+ CAAC 32 E4 82         LD (PlayerRespawnPhase), A
7761+ CAAF AF               XOR A
7762+ CAB0 32 E5 82         LD (PlayerRespawnTimer), A
7763+ CAB3 32 E8 82         LD (PlayerRespawnBeatIdx), A
7764+ CAB6 C9               RET
7765+ CAB7
7766+ CAB7              ; ==============================================================================
7767+ CAB7              ; TriggerDeathBorder - arranca el flash del borde tras morir
7768+ CAB7              ; ==============================================================================
7769+ CAB7              ; Phase 1 (yellow) DEATH_BORDER_YELLOW_FRAMES, luego phase 2 (red) DEATH_BORDER_RED_FRAMES,
7770+ CAB7              ; luego vuelve a negro y se desactiva.
7771+ CAB7              ; ==============================================================================
7772+ CAB7              TriggerDeathBorder:
7773+ CAB7 3E 01            LD A, 1
7774+ CAB9 32 E0 82         LD (DeathBorderPhase), A
7775+ CABC 3E 32            LD A, DEATH_BORDER_YELLOW_FRAMES
7776+ CABE 32 E1 82         LD (DeathBorderTimer), A
7777+ CAC1 3E 06            LD A, YELLOW
7778+ CAC3 32 7C 8D         LD (CurrentBorderColor), A
7779+ CAC6 D3 FE            OUT (254), A
7780+ CAC8 C9               RET
7781+ CAC9
7782+ CAC9              ; ==============================================================================
7783+ CAC9              ; UpdateRespawnBlink - state machine post-respawn (countdown audio + grace timer)
7784+ CAC9              ; ==============================================================================
7785+ CAC9              ; Phase 1: countdown "3, 2, 1" con 3 bips bloqueantes (sin control, invulnerable).
7786+ CAC9              ; Phase 2: 2s grace (con control, invulnerable). No hay efecto visual de momento.
7787+ CAC9              ; ==============================================================================
7788+ CAC9              UpdateRespawnBlink:
7789+ CAC9 3A E4 82         LD A, (PlayerRespawnPhase)
7790+ CACC B7               OR A
7791+ CACD C8               RET Z
7792+ CACE 3D               DEC A
7793+ CACF 28 0D            JR Z, .urbPhase1
7794+ CAD1                  ; Phase 2: solo timer (sin parpadeo)
7795+ CAD1 3A E5 82         LD A, (PlayerRespawnTimer)
7796+ CAD4 3D               DEC A
7797+ CAD5 32 E5 82         LD (PlayerRespawnTimer), A
7798+ CAD8 C0               RET NZ
7799+ CAD9 AF               XOR A
7800+ CADA 32 E4 82         LD (PlayerRespawnPhase), A
7801+ CADD C9               RET
7802+ CADE
7803+ CADE              .urbPhase1:
7804+ CADE                  ; Phase 1: countdown 3-2-1 con bips bloqueantes y silencios entre ellos.
7805+ CADE                  ; Zero input (sin control)
7806+ CADE AF               XOR A
7807+ CADF 32 A4 82         LD (InputDirection), A
7808+ CAE2 32 A5 82         LD (InputFire), A
7809+ CAE5                  ; Blink sync con beep audible: BeepDurationFrames != 0 (sonando) → IDLE,
7810+ CAE5                  ; == 0 (silencio) → PLAYER_BLANK. Sin RAM extra (variable ya existente).
7811+ CAE5 3A A4 6A         LD A, (BeepDurationFrames)
7812+ CAE8 D6 01            SUB 1                               ; CY si era 0 (silencio)
7813+ CAEA 9F               SBC A, A                            ; $FF si silencio, $00 si sonando
7814+ CAEB E6 74            AND SPRID_PLAYER_BLANK
7815+ CAED 32 94 81         LD (EntityTable), A
7816+ CAF0                  ; Si Timer > 0 estamos en silencio entre beats: tickear y volver
7817+ CAF0 3A E5 82         LD A, (PlayerRespawnTimer)
7818+ CAF3 B7               OR A
7819+ CAF4 28 05            JR Z, .urb1FireBeat
7820+ CAF6 3D               DEC A
7821+ CAF7 32 E5 82         LD (PlayerRespawnTimer), A
7822+ CAFA C9               RET
7823+ CAFB              .urb1FireBeat:
7824+ CAFB 3A E8 82         LD A, (PlayerRespawnBeatIdx)
7825+ CAFE 3C               INC A
7826+ CAFF 32 E8 82         LD (PlayerRespawnBeatIdx), A
7827+ CB02 FE 04            CP 4
7828+ CB04 28 12            JR Z, .urb1LastBeat
7829+ CB06 FE 05            CP 5
7830+ CB08 28 1C            JR Z, .urb1AfterBeep        ; beat 5 = "post-GO": grace tras beep largo
7831+ CB0A                  ; Beats 1, 2, 3: pitido corto BASIC-BEEP-style (vol fija + cutoff abrupto)
7832+ CB0A 21 C0 00         LD HL, $00C0                ; ~569 Hz (≈D5, 7 semitonos bajo el A5 original)
7833+ CB0D 06 04            LD B, 4                     ; ~160 ms (4 frames @ 25fps)
7834+ CB0F CD D2 6A         CALL AY_PlayBeep
7835+ CB12                  ; Intervalo entre beeps: 20 frames @ 25fps = 0.8 s. El blink usa CP 10
7836+ CB12                  ; (mitad) para mantener ON/OFF ~50/50.
7837+ CB12 3E 14            LD A, 20
7838+ CB14 32 E5 82         LD (PlayerRespawnTimer), A
7839+ CB17 C9               RET
7840+ CB18              .urb1LastBeat:
7841+ CB18                  ; Beat 4: pitido octava arriba mas largo (= "GO!"). Vol max sostenida +
7842+ CB18                  ; cutoff abrupto tras 11 frames (~440 ms). NO entra en grace todavia:
7843+ CB18                  ; setea timer = 11 (= duracion del beep) → el siguiente fire (idx=5)
7844+ CB18                  ; entra grace EXACTAMENTE al terminar el beep.
7845+ CB18 21 60 00         LD HL, $0060                ; ~1139 Hz (≈D6, octava arriba del corto, 7 semitonos bajo el A6 original)
7846+ CB1B 06 0B            LD B, 11                    ; ~440 ms (11 frames @ 25fps)
7847+ CB1D CD D2 6A         CALL AY_PlayBeep
7848+ CB20 3E 0B            LD A, 11                    ; espera = duracion del beep
7849+ CB22 32 E5 82         LD (PlayerRespawnTimer), A
7850+ CB25 C9               RET
7851+ CB26              .urb1AfterBeep:
7852+ CB26                  ; Beep largo terminado. Phase 2 = control vuelve. Resets ligados al fin
7853+ CB26                  ; del countdown (igual que la version v3 anterior, solo movidos aqui).
7854+ CB26 CD 4E CB         CALL EnterGracePhase            ; phase 2 + timer = RESPAWN_GRACE_FRAMES
7855+ CB29 3E 0C            LD A, SPAWN_INTERVAL
7856+ CB2B 32 EE 82         LD (SpawnTimer), A
7857+ CB2E AF               XOR A
7858+ CB2F 32 F3 82         LD (DeathSpawned), A
7859+ CB32 32 E9 82         LD (MonstersFrozen), A          ; Liberar monsters: AI normal vuelve
7860+ CB35 32 AC 82         LD (TimeFrozen), A              ; Reanudar reloj
7861+ CB38 21 00 00         LD HL, 0
7862+ CB3B 22 F0 82         LD (DeathScreenTimer), HL       ; 16-bit reset
7863+ CB3E                  ; Si los monsters siguen activos (no era game over), reanudar el
7864+ CB3E                  ; secuencer "po-po-popo-po" — fue parado en OnPlayerHealthDepleted.
7865+ CB3E 3A 51 B3         LD A, (MonstersActive)
7866+ CB41 B7               OR A
7867+ CB42 C8               RET Z
7868+ CB43                  ; No re-arrancar si los 3 monsters estan atrapados en la iglesia
7869+ CB43                  ; (StopMonstersMusic se llamo en TriggerChurchTrap del 3o; ya no hay
7870+ CB43                  ; monsters jugables en pantalla aunque MonstersActive siga 1).
7871+ CB43 3A B7 82         LD A, (MonsterTrappedFlags)
7872+ CB46 E6 07            AND $07
7873+ CB48 FE 07            CP $07
7874+ CB4A C8               RET Z
7875+ CB4B C3 16 FB         JP StartMonstersMusic           ; tail-call
7876+ CB4E
7877+ CB4E              ; ==============================================================================
7878+ CB4E              ; EnterGracePhase - Activa Phase 2 (gracia con blink) por RESPAWN_GRACE_FRAMES
7879+ CB4E              ; ==============================================================================
7880+ CB4E              ; Llamado desde:
7881+ CB4E              ;   - urb1LastBeat: tras los 3 pitidos del countdown del respawn.
7882+ CB4E              ;   - CheckPlayerEnemyCollision.pHpDmgNotZero: tras cada hit de nasty/monster.
7883+ CB4E              ; Activa invulnerabilidad (.playerHit chequea PlayerRespawnPhase != 0) y blink
7884+ CB4E              ; (UpdatePlayer chequea PlayerRespawnTimer != 0).
7885+ CB4E              ; ==============================================================================
7886+ CB4E              EnterGracePhase:
7887+ CB4E 3E 02            LD A, 2
7888+ CB50 32 E4 82         LD (PlayerRespawnPhase), A
7889+ CB53 3E 19            LD A, RESPAWN_GRACE_FRAMES
7890+ CB55 32 E5 82         LD (PlayerRespawnTimer), A
7891+ CB58 C9               RET
7892+ CB59
7893+ CB59              ; ==============================================================================
7894+ CB59              ; UpdateDeathAnim - tick de la anim de muerte del player durante phase 1 (yellow)
7895+ CB59              ; ==============================================================================
7896+ CB59              ; Avanza ENT_SPRITEID +1 cada PLAYER_DEATH_ANIM_DELAY frames. La base (110 right
7897+ CB59              ; o 113 left) se fija en OnPlayerHealthDepleted; aqui solo incrementamos.
7898+ CB59              ; Al llegar al ultimo frame, se queda ahi (resto del yellow en frame final).
7899+ CB59              ; ==============================================================================
7900+ CB59              UpdateDeathAnim:
7901+ CB59 3A E0 82         LD A, (DeathBorderPhase)
7902+ CB5C FE 01            CP 1
7903+ CB5E C0               RET NZ
7904+ CB5F 3A E2 82         LD A, (PlayerDeathAnimTimer)
7905+ CB62 3D               DEC A
7906+ CB63 32 E2 82         LD (PlayerDeathAnimTimer), A
7907+ CB66 C0               RET NZ
7908+ CB67                  ; Tick consumido: avanzar frame
7909+ CB67 3A E3 82         LD A, (PlayerDeathAnimFrame)
7910+ CB6A 3C               INC A
7911+ CB6B FE 03            CP PLAYER_DEATH_ANIM_FRAMES
7912+ CB6D D0               RET NC                              ; ya en ultimo frame (clamp)
7913+ CB6E 32 E3 82         LD (PlayerDeathAnimFrame), A
7914+ CB71 DD 21 94 81      LD IX, EntityTable
7915+ CB75 DD 34 00         INC (IX+ENT_SPRITEID)               ; siguiente frame de la anim
7916+ CB78                  ; Al entrar en el ULTIMO frame (= "desparramado en el suelo") reproducir
7917+ CB78                  ; el SFX del puff (mismo que la muerte de un nasty). El A actual contiene
7918+ CB78                  ; el frame recien escrito; comparamos con el ultimo (FRAMES-1).
7919+ CB78 FE 02            CP PLAYER_DEATH_ANIM_FRAMES - 1
7920+ CB7A 20 06            JR NZ, .udaSkipSplatSfx
7921+ CB7C 21 A3 F9         LD HL, SFX_EnemyDeath
7922+ CB7F CD 24 F9         CALL PlaySFX
7923+ CB82              .udaSkipSplatSfx:
7924+ CB82 3E 0D            LD A, PLAYER_DEATH_ANIM_DELAY
7925+ CB84 32 E2 82         LD (PlayerDeathAnimTimer), A
7926+ CB87 C9               RET
7927+ CB88
7928+ CB88              ; ==============================================================================
7929+ CB88              ; UpdateDeathBorder - tick por frame; transiciona fase amarillo -> rojo -> negro
7930+ CB88              ; ==============================================================================
7931+ CB88              UpdateDeathBorder:
7932+ CB88 3A E0 82         LD A, (DeathBorderPhase)
7933+ CB8B B7               OR A
7934+ CB8C C8               RET Z
7935+ CB8D 3A E1 82         LD A, (DeathBorderTimer)
7936+ CB90 3D               DEC A
7937+ CB91 32 E1 82         LD (DeathBorderTimer), A
7938+ CB94 C0               RET NZ
7939+ CB95                  ; Timer expiro: avanzar fase
7940+ CB95 3A E0 82         LD A, (DeathBorderPhase)
7941+ CB98 FE 01            CP 1
7942+ CB9A 20 33            JR NZ, .udbToBlack
7943+ CB9C                  ; --- Fin fase amarillo ---
7944+ CB9C                  ; Si PlayerLives==0 -> game over directo (sin pasar por rojo).
7945+ CB9C                  ; Si quedan vidas -> fase rojo 3s + sprite a BLANK (player invisible).
7946+ CB9C 3A D7 82         LD A, (PlayerLives)
7947+ CB9F B7               OR A
7948+ CBA0 28 1F            JR Z, .udbToGameOver
7949+ CBA2 DD 21 94 81      LD IX, EntityTable
7950+ CBA6 DD 36 00 74      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_PLAYER_BLANK
7951+ CBAA 3E 02            LD A, 2
7952+ CBAC 32 E0 82         LD (DeathBorderPhase), A
7953+ CBAF 3E 32            LD A, DEATH_BORDER_RED_FRAMES
7954+ CBB1 32 E1 82         LD (DeathBorderTimer), A
7955+ CBB4 3E 02            LD A, RED
7956+ CBB6 32 7C 8D         LD (CurrentBorderColor), A
7957+ CBB9 D3 FE            OUT (254), A
7958+ CBBB                  ; Pedir tumba in-place: ProcessPlayer va a borrar el sprite muerte este
7959+ CBBB                  ; mismo frame; DrawPendingTomb (tras ProcessPlayer) la pintara encima.
7960+ CBBB 3E 01            LD A, 1
7961+ CBBD 32 ED 82         LD (TombDrawPending), A
7962+ CBC0 C9               RET
7963+ CBC1              .udbToGameOver:
7964+ CBC1                  ; Pasar borde a negro y disparar pantalla GAME OVER (reemplaza al rojo).
7965+ CBC1 AF               XOR A
7966+ CBC2 32 E0 82         LD (DeathBorderPhase), A
7967+ CBC5 3E 00            LD A, BLACK
7968+ CBC7 32 7C 8D         LD (CurrentBorderColor), A
7969+ CBCA D3 FE            OUT (254), A
7970+ CBCC C3 DD CB         JP ShowGameOver
7971+ CBCF              .udbToBlack:
7972+ CBCF                  ; Phase 2 (rojo) terminado -> negro + respawn del player en LastEntryPos
7973+ CBCF AF               XOR A
7974+ CBD0 32 E0 82         LD (DeathBorderPhase), A
7975+ CBD3 3E 00            LD A, BLACK
7976+ CBD5 32 7C 8D         LD (CurrentBorderColor), A
7977+ CBD8 D3 FE            OUT (254), A
7978+ CBDA C3 60 CA         JP RespawnPlayerAtEntry             ; tail-call
7979+ CBDD
7980+ CBDD              ; ==============================================================================
7981+ CBDD              ; ShowGameOver - solo arma el flag; MainLoop pinta la pantalla en la siguiente iter
7982+ CBDD              ; ==============================================================================
7983+ CBDD              ; Llamado desde mid-frame en OnPlayerHealthDepleted. NO pinta aqui porque el
7984+ CBDD              ; resto del frame (ProcessEnemies, HUD, etc.) sobreescribiria la pantalla.
7985+ CBDD              ; MainLoop al ver GameOver=1 hace PaintGameOverScreen y pasa a GameOver=2.
7986+ CBDD              ; ==============================================================================
7987+ CBDD              ShowGameOver:
7988+ CBDD 3E 01            LD A, 1
7989+ CBDF 32 D8 82         LD (GameOver), A
7990+ CBE2 C9               RET
7991+ CBE3
7992+ CBE3              ; --- PaintGameOverScreen: wipe + init moonwalk anim. Llamado UNA vez por MainLoop. ---
7993+ CBE3              ; La animacion en si la dibuja UpdateGameOverAnim cada frame mientras GameOver=2.
7994+ CBE3              PaintGameOverScreen:
7995+ CBE3                  ; Wipe pixels
7996+ CBE3 21 00 40         LD HL, $4000
7997+ CBE6 11 01 40         LD DE, $4001
7998+ CBE9 01 FF 17         LD BC, $17FF
7999+ CBEC 36 00            LD (HL), 0
8000+ CBEE ED B0            LDIR
8001+ CBF0                  ; Attrs $47 (white ink, black paper, bright) en toda la pantalla
8002+ CBF0 21 00 58         LD HL, $5800
8003+ CBF3 11 01 58         LD DE, $5801
8004+ CBF6 01 FF 02         LD BC, $02FF
8005+ CBF9 36 47            LD (HL), $47
8006+ CBFB ED B0            LDIR
8007+ CBFD                  ; Tumba 2x centrada (sprite ID 144, "little house cemetery") sobre la que
8008+ CBFD                  ; la muerte hará el moonwalk. Cold path: 1 vez por partida.
8009+ CBFD CD 57 6C         CALL DrawTombstone2xCentered
8010+ CC00                  ; Init anim moonwalk: empieza en X_MAX facing R (slide left).
8011+ CC00 3E 88            LD A, GAMEOVER_ANIM_X_MAX
8012+ CC02 32 D9 82         LD (GameOverAnimX), A
8013+ CC05 AF               XOR A
8014+ CC06 32 DA 82         LD (GameOverAnimDir), A
8015+ CC09 32 DB 82         LD (GameOverAnimFrame), A
8016+ CC0C 32 DF 82         LD (GameOverAnimLastX), A
8017+ CC0F 21 00 00         LD HL, 0
8018+ CC12 22 DD 82         LD (GameOverAnimLastSpr), HL    ; Sin erase la primera vez
8019+ CC15 3E 06            LD A, GAMEOVER_ANIM_FRAME_TICKS
8020+ CC17 32 DC 82         LD (GameOverAnimFrameTimer), A
8021+ CC1A                  ; Jingle de game over (track 3). UpdateMusic se llama cada frame en MainLoop
8022+ CC1A                  ; antes del guard de GameOver, asi que la pista sigue avanzando con el juego
8023+ CC1A                  ; congelado en GameOver=2.
8024+ CC1A 3E 03            LD A, 3
8025+ CC1C C3 B3 99         JP StartMusic                   ; tail-call
8026+ CC1F
8027+ CC1F              ; ==============================================================================
8028+ CC1F              ; UpdateGameOverAnim — Death moonwalkea por la pantalla negra
8029+ CC1F              ; ==============================================================================
8030+ CC1F              ; Llamado cada frame desde MainLoop mientras GameOver=2. Anim ping-pong:
8031+ CC1F              ;   dir=0 → slide LEFT  (X: MAX → 0) usando sprites de movimiento DERECHO
8032+ CC1F              ;   dir=1 → slide RIGHT (X: 0 → MAX) usando sprites de movimiento IZQUIERDO
8033+ CC1F              ; Sprites invertidos vs direccion = efecto moonwalk: el cuerpo desliza al
8034+ CC1F              ; contrario de los pies. Aprovecha que en este juego SprDeath_0/1 son el par
8035+ CC1F              ; usado para DELTAX<0 (mover izquierda) y SprDeath_L0/L1 para DELTAX>0.
8036+ CC1F              ; XOR-erase con el ptr+X guardado del frame anterior. Toggle del frame interno
8037+ CC1F              ; cada FRAME_TICKS frames. Init via PaintGameOverScreen.
8038+ CC1F              ;
8039+ CC1F              ; X bound a [0, 224] para que el sprite 24x24 no overflow VRAM en path
8040+ CC1F              ; shifted (que ocupa 4 chars = 32 px).
8041+ CC1F              ; ==============================================================================
8042+ CC1F              ; Tumba 2x ocupa pixel Y range 80..159 (charY 10..19). La muerte (24x24) baila
8043+ CC1F              ; justo encima del techo: Y_top=56 → Y_bottom=79, 1 px de hueco al techo.
8044+ CC1F              ; X swing centrado sobre la tumba:
8045+ CC1F              ;   X_MIN: 96  = char 12 (2 chars dentro del borde izq de la tumba en char 10)
8046+ CC1F              ;   X_MAX: 136 = char 17 (3 chars dentro del borde der de la tumba en char 22)
8047+ CC1F              ;   Death sprite 24 px wide → visual cubre chars 12..19 (centrado).
8048+ CC1F              GAMEOVER_ANIM_Y           EQU 56
8049+ CC1F              GAMEOVER_ANIM_X_MIN       EQU 96
8050+ CC1F              GAMEOVER_ANIM_X_MAX       EQU 136
8051+ CC1F              GAMEOVER_ANIM_FRAME_TICKS EQU 6
8052+ CC1F
8053+ CC1F              UpdateGameOverAnim:
8054+ CC1F                  ; --- Erase del sprite previo (si lo hubo) ---
8055+ CC1F 2A DD 82         LD HL, (GameOverAnimLastSpr)
8056+ CC22 7C               LD A, H
8057+ CC23 B5               OR L
8058+ CC24 28 0C            JR Z, .ugoaNoErase
8059+ CC26 E5               PUSH HL
8060+ CC27 DD E1            POP IX
8061+ CC29 3A DF 82         LD A, (GameOverAnimLastX)
8062+ CC2C 5F               LD E, A
8063+ CC2D 16 38            LD D, GAMEOVER_ANIM_Y
8064+ CC2F CD E0 99         CALL DrawSprite
8065+ CC32              .ugoaNoErase:
8066+ CC32
8067+ CC32                  ; --- Tick frame timer (R0 ↔ R1 cada FRAME_TICKS frames) ---
8068+ CC32 3A DC 82         LD A, (GameOverAnimFrameTimer)
8069+ CC35 3D               DEC A
8070+ CC36 20 0A            JR NZ, .ugoaTimerSet
8071+ CC38 3A DB 82         LD A, (GameOverAnimFrame)
8072+ CC3B EE 01            XOR 1
8073+ CC3D 32 DB 82         LD (GameOverAnimFrame), A
8074+ CC40 3E 06            LD A, GAMEOVER_ANIM_FRAME_TICKS
8075+ CC42              .ugoaTimerSet:
8076+ CC42 32 DC 82         LD (GameOverAnimFrameTimer), A
8077+ CC45
8078+ CC45                  ; --- Avanzar X segun direccion (ping-pong) ---
