2342+ D86B              ; UpdatePickupFlash - Parpadeo on/off de un pickup recién spawnado.
2343+ D86B              ; ==============================================================================
2344+ D86B              ; Cada PICKUP_FLASH_PERIOD frames hace un XOR redraw del sprite (toggle
2345+ D86B              ; visible/invisible). Tras PickupFlashToggles toggles para de parpadear.
2346+ D86B              ; Como toggles inicial es par, termina en estado visible.
2347+ D86B              ; Llamado desde MainLoop tras RefreshPickupAttrs.
2348+ D86B              ; ==============================================================================
2349+ D86B              UpdatePickupFlash:
2350+ D86B 3A CB 82         LD A, (PickupFlashToggles)
2351+ D86E B7               OR A
2352+ D86F C8               RET Z                       ; no hay parpadeo activo
2353+ D870 3A CC 82         LD A, (PickupFlashFrames)
2354+ D873 3D               DEC A
2355+ D874 32 CC 82         LD (PickupFlashFrames), A
2356+ D877 B7               OR A
2357+ D878 C0               RET NZ                      ; aún no toca toggle
2358+ D879                  ; Reset frame counter, decrementar toggles
2359+ D879 3E 03            LD A, PICKUP_FLASH_PERIOD
2360+ D87B 32 CC 82         LD (PickupFlashFrames), A
2361+ D87E 3A CB 82         LD A, (PickupFlashToggles)
2362+ D881 3D               DEC A
2363+ D882 32 CB 82         LD (PickupFlashToggles), A
