2761+ DA99 E5               PUSH HL
2762+ DA9A 21 20 DB         LD HL, BgGfx_random_pickup
2763+ DA9D B7               OR A
2764+ DA9E ED 52            SBC HL, DE
2765+ DAA0 E1               POP HL
