2888+ DB45              .dkhDraw:
2889+ DB45                  ; A = 1..6: sacar el BgGfx ptr de KeyLockTable[A-1]
2890+ DB45 3D               DEC A
2891+ DB46 87               ADD A, A                    ; *2 (DEFW size)
2892+ DB47 6F               LD L, A
2893+ DB48 26 00            LD H, 0
2894+ DB4A 11 45 D7         LD DE, KeyLockTable
2895+ DB4D 19               ADD HL, DE
