 872+ F2B0 21 18 58         LD HL, $5800 + COMPASS_CHARROW * $20 + COMPASS_COL
 873+ F2B3 77               LD (HL), A
 874+ F2B4 23               INC HL
 875+ F2B5 77               LD (HL), A
 876+ F2B6 21 38 58         LD HL, $5800 + (COMPASS_CHARROW + 1) * $20 + COMPASS_COL
