1927+ F880 3A 02 83         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
1928+ F883 B8               CP B
1929+ F884 20 0B            JR NZ, .dcghHideInvalidate
1930+ F886 3A 20 F9         LD A, (HintLastDir)
1931+ F889 47               LD B, A
1932+ F88A 3A 21 F9         LD A, (HintLastCoord)
