 195+ FA00              ; --- SFX_CountdownTick: bip ~700ms para "3" y "2" del countdown ---
 196+ FA00              ; Pitch 102 = ~1047 Hz. Calibrado para octava precisa con pitch 50 (ratio 1.992).
 197+ FA00              ; (PlaySFX tiene ~78T de overhead por ciclo ademas de 32*pitch -> ratio puro
 198+ FA00              ; 100/50 quedaria desafinado ~30 cents. Compensado a 102 da ~7 cents.)
 199+ FA00              SFX_CountdownTick:
 200+ FA00 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~239ms
 201+ FA04 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~478ms
