 602  E58C                  ; --- Town gate cutscene body (~1200 B, slot 1 -> bank 7 move) ---
 603  E58C                  ; Body movible: phase machine + anim helpers + DrawTheEnd + DrawCredits +
 604  E58C                  ; PrintStringFontAt + DrawCharFontAt + SFX stubs + TownGateCreditsData.
 605  E58C                  ; Entry thunks (CheckTownGateTriggerBg / UpdateTownGateCutscene) viven en
 606  E58C                  ; bank_cutscene_thunks.asm (slot 1) con SP swap igual que bank_cutscene.
 607  E58C                  ; Comparten alt_stack porque las 2 cinematicas son mutuamente exclusivas
 608  E58C                  ; (M11 vs M9). Funciones que se quedan en slot 1 (town_gate_cutscene.asm):
 609  E58C                  ; KillDeathIfActive, TownGate*Player*, BiClip, SlideErase/Draw,
 610  E58C                  ; AllNastiesDeadCheck — usadas por bank_cutscene o paginan slot 3.
