 552+ E828              ; ==============================================================================
 553+ E828              ; TownGateDecTimer - decrementa TownGateTimer, devuelve Z si llego a 0
 554+ E828              ; ==============================================================================
 555+ E828              TownGateDecTimer:
 556+ E828 3A A5 5F         LD A, (TownGateTimer)
 557+ E82B 3D               DEC A
 558+ E82C 32 A5 5F         LD (TownGateTimer), A
