 924+ EEE9                  ; Dispatch effect via saved rolled type
 925+ EEE9 78               LD A, B
 926+ EEEA FE 06            CP ROLLED_ROULETTE
 926+ EEEC 28 26          JR Z, .crsApplyRouletteHit
 927+ EEEE FE 01            CP ROLLED_LIFE
