 952+ EF33 FE 05            CP ROUL_CARACOL
 952+ EF35 CA B8 EB       JP Z, ApplyCaracolBuff
 953+ EF38 FE 06            CP ROUL_MUSHROOM
 953+ EF3A CA 8D EB       JP Z, ApplyMushroomBuff
